# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Kolibri-1, profile "dedicated": the GPU drives no display.
# 131k at q8_0/q8_0, every expert in RAM, ubatch 2048. Only 10 of the 50 layers keep the whole
# window (the others a 513-token sliding window), so the cache is ~1.4 GB at 131k. By arithmetic
# from 3 362 MiB at 32k f16 ubatch 512, not filled. See docs/kolibri1.md#window-and-profiles.
# The budget is Qwen3.6's, by the rules in docs/agent.md#context-budget: the same speed.
: "${CTX:=131072}"
: "${CPU_MOE:=50}"
: "${UB:=2048}"
: "${BUDGET:=16384}"
: "${MAX_TOKENS:=32000}"
: "${RESERVE_TOKENS:=32000}"
: "${KEEP_RECENT_TOKENS:=24000}"
